<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15">
  <head>
    <metadata>
      <ttm:title>SIMPLE</ttm:title>
      <ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">shae</ttm:agent>
      <ttm:item type="album">SIMPLE</ttm:item>
      <ttm:item type="spotify_id">6ElCczaaYtcaBf2bcPfqKM</ttm:item>
      <itunes:duration>03:31.000</itunes:duration>
    </metadata>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold"/>
      <style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:12.190" end="00:13.690" ttm:agent="v1">Sleep in the night</p>
      <p begin="00:13.240" end="00:14.820" ttm:agent="v1">Don't bother hoping</p>
      <p begin="00:14.820" end="00:17.540" ttm:agent="v1">For me to sacrifice my time</p>
      <p begin="00:17.540" end="00:19.040" ttm:agent="v1">Protecting your peace</p>
      <p begin="00:18.700" end="00:20.200" ttm:agent="v1">Means losing you sleep</p>
      <p begin="00:20.090" end="00:23.080" ttm:agent="v1">Just to daydream</p>
      <p begin="00:23.080" end="00:24.580" ttm:agent="v1">I have my guard up</p>
      <p begin="00:24.430" end="00:25.930" ttm:agent="v1">I'll admit it</p>
      <p begin="00:25.730" end="00:28.430" ttm:agent="v1">Trusting you makes me lose my mind</p>
      <p begin="00:28.430" end="00:29.930" ttm:agent="v1">I'm sorry to ask</p>
      <p begin="00:29.620" end="00:31.120" ttm:agent="v1">Can you do with that</p>
      <p begin="00:31.100" end="00:33.220" ttm:agent="v1">Or maybe just don't</p>
      <p begin="00:33.220" end="00:41.220" ttm:agent="v1">Write my name on your breath, let me go</p>
      <p begin="00:41.430" end="00:44.270" ttm:agent="v1">But I don't want to be without you</p>
      <p begin="00:44.270" end="00:49.560" ttm:agent="v1">Maybe I'm just meant to be alone</p>
      <p begin="00:49.560" end="00:51.730" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I don't want to hurt you</p>
      <p begin="00:51.730" end="00:55.530" ttm:agent="v1">And just leave you feeling like we're something more</p>
      <p begin="00:55.530" end="00:57.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">There's nothing new with you (Ooh, oh-oh)</p>
      <p begin="00:57.590" end="01:00.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I've felt this way with others before (Others before)</p>
      <p begin="01:00.990" end="01:02.600" ttm:agent="v1">So keep it simple</p>
      <p begin="01:02.600" end="01:05.040" ttm:agent="v1">Don't make me want you more</p>
      <p begin="01:05.040" end="01:11.170" ttm:agent="v1">It's okay, we'll be fine, it'll all be alright</p>
      <p begin="01:11.170" end="01:14.470" ttm:agent="v1">Just please don't say I love you and then</p>
      <p begin="01:14.470" end="01:17.600" ttm:agent="v1">Say goodbye</p>
      <p begin="01:17.600" end="01:20.430" ttm:agent="v1">I'm keeping my ego on the surface</p>
      <p begin="01:20.430" end="01:22.980" ttm:agent="v1">Letting you tread in my memories</p>
      <p begin="01:22.980" end="01:24.480" ttm:agent="v1">You're so good to me</p>
      <p begin="01:24.280" end="01:25.780" ttm:agent="v1">Your pride is so weak</p>
      <p begin="01:25.570" end="01:27.940" ttm:agent="v1">How can you be so</p>
      <p begin="01:27.940" end="01:30.430" ttm:agent="v1">Gentle and a pacifist</p>
      <p begin="01:30.430" end="01:33.640" ttm:agent="v1">Your nonsense is my happiness</p>
      <p begin="01:33.640" end="01:35.670" ttm:agent="v1">By the way, you've seen all my scars</p>
      <p begin="01:35.670" end="01:37.170" ttm:agent="v1">Nobody's made it this far</p>
      <p begin="01:37.050" end="01:38.990" ttm:agent="v1">Still I'm telling you, please don't</p>
      <p begin="01:38.990" end="01:46.980" ttm:agent="v1">Write my name on your breath, let me go</p>
      <p begin="01:46.980" end="01:49.730" ttm:agent="v1">But I don't want to be without you</p>
      <p begin="01:49.730" end="01:57.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Maybe I'm just meant to be alone (Alone)</p>
      <p begin="02:00.960" end="02:03.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">There's nothing new with you (Ooh, ooh-ooh)</p>
      <p begin="02:03.110" end="02:06.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I've felt this way with others before (Others before)</p>
      <p begin="02:06.470" end="02:07.970" ttm:agent="v1">So keep it simple</p>
      <p begin="02:07.780" end="02:10.510" ttm:agent="v1">Don't make me want you more</p>
      <p begin="02:10.510" end="02:16.570" ttm:agent="v1">It's okay, we'll be fine, it'll all be alright</p>
      <p begin="02:16.570" end="02:19.810" ttm:agent="v1">Just please don't say I love you and then</p>
      <p begin="02:19.810" end="02:22.650" ttm:agent="v1">Say goodbye</p>
      <p begin="02:22.650" end="02:25.550" ttm:agent="v1">So, here's to hoping it's not you</p>
      <p begin="02:25.550" end="02:28.260" ttm:agent="v1">Who will walk out of that door</p>
      <p begin="02:28.260" end="02:32.170" ttm:agent="v1">I'm sorry for the way I'm so insecure</p>
      <p begin="02:32.170" end="02:38.470" ttm:agent="v1">It's okay, we'll be fine, it'll all be alright</p>
      <p begin="02:38.470" end="02:41.740" ttm:agent="v1">Just please don't say I love you and then</p>
      <p begin="02:41.740" end="02:45.380" ttm:agent="v1">Say goodbye</p>
      <p begin="02:45.380" end="02:47.980" ttm:agent="v1">Du-du-du-du-du-du-du</p>
      <p begin="02:47.980" end="02:50.680" ttm:agent="v1">Du-du-du-du-du-du-du</p>
      <p begin="02:50.680" end="02:53.440" ttm:agent="v1">Du-du-du-du-du-du-du</p>
      <p begin="02:53.440" end="02:56.140" ttm:agent="v1">Du-du-du-du-du-du</p>
      <p begin="02:56.140" end="02:58.790" ttm:agent="v1">Du-du-du-du-du-du-du</p>
      <p begin="02:58.790" end="03:01.570" ttm:agent="v1">Du-du-du-du-du-du-du</p>
      <p begin="03:01.570" end="03:04.420" ttm:agent="v1">Du-du-du-du-du-du-du</p>
      <p begin="03:04.420" end="03:05.920" ttm:agent="v1">Du-du-du-du-du-du</p>
      <p begin="03:05.880" end="03:09.820" ttm:agent="v1">I'm sorry, please don't be without me</p>
      <p begin="03:09.820" end="03:12.160" ttm:agent="v1">If I give you my soul</p>
      <p begin="03:12.160" end="03:16.900" ttm:agent="v1">Then you'll never know</p>
      <p begin="03:16.900" end="03:21.070" ttm:agent="v1">Silence, like we're at a party</p>
      <p begin="03:21.070" end="03:23.530" ttm:agent="v1">I'll need you around me</p>
      <p begin="03:23.530" end="03:29.770" ttm:agent="v1">Never alone</p>
      <p begin="03:29.770" end="03:33.770" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
